#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/sem_close.3:25
msgid ""
"B<sem_close>()  closes the named semaphore referred to by I<sem>, allowing "
"any resources that the system has allocated to the calling process for this "
"semaphore to be freed."
msgstr ""

